window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A runaway bride. Her handsome getaway driver. A cozy town with a cast of animated citizens to help them figure it all out.</p> <p>Noelle’s getting married three days before Christmas. It’s a dream come true . . . for her mother. For Noelle, it’s starting to feel like the walls are closing in. She’s known for months that something’s changing, namely her fiancé. She’s tried to ignore it, but her gut’s telling her that she’s marrying the wrong person.</p> <p>Nash retired from the military three months ago. He’s exhausted and just wants to be left alone. His high school teammate’s getting married in a few days. He has no desire to go to the wedding, but every time he tries to throw out the invitation, an alarm goes off in his head. For some reason, he feels like he’s supposed to be there.</p> <p>It's thirty minutes before the ceremony begins. Noelle’s in her wedding dress. Nash is in his seat. The universe is desperately trying to bring these two strangers together, but will Nash and Noelle listen to their hearts before it’s too late?</p>"; 
